<title>INDIA: India produced 4,346 tonnes of lead in November.</title>
<headline>India produced 4,346 tonnes of lead in November.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 4,346 tonnes of lead in November 1996 against a target of 5,115 tonnes, a government statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The country produced 27,828 tonnes of lead during April-November 1996 compared with 27,420 in the same period last year, the statement said.</p>
</text>
